WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.243
In tutorial 7.7, you'll record the
monthly Search Console check-in,

00:00:11.293 --> 00:00:12.951
so problems are caught early.

00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:19.566
First, open Alerts & check-ins. The top
shows your open alerts, your last check-in,

00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:21.796
and the pages Google hasn't indexed.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.836
Once a month, click Record a
check-in. It only takes a few minutes.

00:00:28.815 --> 00:00:34.190
In Search Console, look for manual actions,
meaning a penalty, and security issues.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.918
Then answer No, nothing
listed, or Yes, there is one.

00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:43.091
Not sure where to look? Click Where do I
look?, and a guide walks you through it.

00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:48.516
Each step opens the right
page in Search Console,

00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:50.347
and tells you what you should see there.

00:00:52.462 --> 00:00:55.812
Next, export the Pages
report from Search Console,

00:00:55.862 --> 00:01:01.507
and choose the Table.csv file here. It
shows why some pages aren't indexed.

00:01:02.515 --> 00:01:06.365
Add any notes, check the summary,
and click Record the check-in.

00:01:06.415 --> 00:01:08.507
It's added to your monthly check-ins.

00:01:09.447 --> 00:01:11.272
Back on Alerts & check-ins,

00:01:11.322 --> 00:01:15.122
Monthly check-ins charts the
pages not indexed month by month,

00:01:15.172 --> 00:01:16.750
with every check-in below.

00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:23.240
And Search Console alerts lists the warnings
Google sends you, matched to your site,

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.747
so nothing slips by.

00:01:26.011 --> 00:01:27.986
So each month takes a few minutes,

00:01:28.036 --> 00:01:32.674
and the problems only Search Console
can see are on record, and caught early.

00:01:33.673 --> 00:01:38.823
So, open Alerts & check-ins, record
the check-in, upload the Pages report,

00:01:38.873 --> 00:01:41.022
and review past months and alerts.

00:01:42.026 --> 00:01:44.476
Your check-in is on record. Next,

00:01:44.526 --> 00:01:49.158
see what Google and AI crawlers
fetch on your site, in tutorial 7.8.
